{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788049921856915521,"compiled_state":{"alias":"brainy-convulsant-unicorn","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"c6799486667ff92cb0645282a0f4113882214eb2c175f9d43bcf600148ce8ba1","event_uuid":"acb6fa50-5079-4731-becb-0f752a90b0f5","position":{"commit_sha":"073cdb01e3b1bf324e5e520af8cac016d167d7dd","position":"1788045342307125671-acb6fa50-5079-4731-becb-0f752a90b0f5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"549407472a63f28ca4527abf39f2d3f820833aae79affffe26158268ac368633","event_uuid":"77bce49b-396c-4bb9-a691-256a67ff101f","position":{"commit_sha":"200677a3ff47bb79f3fe740d56fdb494c33f6eea","position":"1788045350931308624-77bce49b-396c-4bb9-a691-256a67ff101f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788045342307125671,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"77bce49b-396c-4bb9-a691-256a67ff101f","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"35ab-f0e0-3e4a-4b72"}],"description":"Discovered during the Step 7 sibling sweep of 35ab-f0e0-3e4a-4b72 (fightable-nirvanic-kitten).\n\n## Site\n`ExpressionError(WorkflowError)` — defined at `src/rebar/llm/workflow/executor.py:251`, raised from `src/rebar/llm/workflow/interpreter.py` (lines ~144-205) and `executor.py` (~262-307) for execute-time expression-resolution failures: an input not set, a step that produced no such output, a loop/map var not in scope, a secret/env var not available, an unresolvable `${{ }}` expression.\n\n## Symptom\n`error_code_for(ExpressionError(...))` → `llm_unavailable` (it is a `WorkflowError` subclass and falls through to branch 7). An execute-time wiring/output-resolution failure is not an LLM outage, so this is arguably a misclassification of the same family as 35ab.\n\n## Why a follow-up rather than an inline fix\nThe correct code is a design decision. Unlike the executor unknown-step (a plan-authoring invalid workflow → `invalid_input`, fixed under 35ab), an `ExpressionError` fires at EXECUTE time — the same phase dbca deliberately kept mapping to `llm_unavailable` to protect genuine outages (AC3). Whether an execute-time expression-resolution failure should become `invalid_input` (caller wiring bug), a new code, or legitimately stay on the execute base needs an operator ruling. Its docstring notes it is \"a value the linter could not have known was missing,\" i.e. a runtime-state fault, which blurs the caller-vs-execute line.\n\n## Acceptance (needs operator input)\n- [ ] Operator decides whether ExpressionError should be reclassified (and to what) or intentionally remain `llm_unavailable` as an execute-base failure.\n- [ ] If reclassified: subclass + `error_code_for` mapping + tests through the real surface; execute-time genuine outages still `llm_unavailable`.\n\nShares the parent's origin 8a31-e1c3-cf31-4239 (blanket LLMError→llm_unavailable).","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"73d8-4871-1b49-4047","ticket_type":"bug","title":"ExpressionError (execute-time workflow wiring) also classifies as llm_unavailable — decide correct code","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["acb6fa50-5079-4731-becb-0f752a90b0f5","77bce49b-396c-4bb9-a691-256a67ff101f"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788049921856915521,"uuid":"b2cd1f94-6429-4953-a21f-a80893a2c07c"}